  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kyrgyz Health Results Based Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to (1) pilot performance-based payments and/or enhanced supervision for quality of maternal and neonatal care in randomly selected rayon hospitals; and (2) strengthen the Government&#x2019;s and providers&#x2019; capacity in performance-based contracting and monitoring and evaluating for results.</narrative>
  </description>
